<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1746254103"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:59.549"><div begin="27.112" end="37.493" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="27.112" end="30.131" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.112" end="27.734">有什麼</span><span begin="27.734" end="28.120">关</span><span begin="28.120" end="28.975">系 删掉无</span><span begin="28.975" end="29.362">聊</span><span begin="29.362" end="29.813">的理</span><span begin="29.813" end="30.131">由</span></p><p begin="30.372" end="33.250" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.372" end="31.054">把沉重</span><span begin="31.054" end="31.405">身</span><span begin="31.405" end="32.269">体 传送到</span><span begin="32.269" end="32.677">热</span><span begin="32.677" end="33.082">带气</span><span begin="33.082" end="33.250">候</span></p><p begin="33.260" end="37.493" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.260" end="33.914">脑袋放</span><span begin="33.914" end="34.545">空</span> <span begin="36.525" end="37.157">吹吹海</span><span begin="37.157" end="37.493">风</span></p></div><div begin="40.264" end="50.993" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="40.264" end="43.294" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.264" end="40.893">用一场</span><span begin="40.893" end="41.248">远</span><span begin="41.248" end="42.106">行 当做逃</span><span begin="42.106" end="42.492">离</span><span begin="42.492" end="42.916">的方</span><span begin="42.916" end="43.294">舟</span></p><p begin="43.503" end="46.403" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.503" end="44.169">做生活</span><span begin="44.169" end="44.582">困</span><span begin="44.582" end="45.386">兽 不如去</span><span begin="45.386" end="45.778">浪</span><span begin="45.778" end="46.229">漫宇</span><span begin="46.229" end="46.403">宙</span></p><p begin="46.413" end="50.993" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.413" end="47.031">烦恼忧</span><span begin="47.031" end="47.593">愁</span> <span begin="49.496" end="50.304">全部都抽</span><span begin="50.304" end="50.993">空</span></p></div><div begin="52.748" end="1:03.338" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="52.748" end="55.698" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.748" end="53.820">看霓虹长出</span><span begin="53.820" end="54.187">柔</span><span begin="54.187" end="54.430">软</span><span begin="54.430" end="55.244">的触</span><span begin="55.244" end="55.698">角</span></p><p begin="55.869" end="58.948" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.869" end="57.097">给单调的人换</span><span begin="57.097" end="57.500">上</span><span begin="57.500" end="57.721">缤</span><span begin="57.721" end="58.546">纷躯</span><span begin="58.546" end="58.948">壳</span></p><p begin="59.129" end="1:03.338" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.129" end="1:00.422">下一步向左向</span><span begin="1:00.422" end="1:00.758">右</span><span begin="1:00.758" end="1:00.976">看</span><span begin="1:00.976" end="1:02.231">心情都</span><span begin="1:02.231" end="1:02.666">不重</span><span begin="1:02.666" end="1:03.338">要</span></p></div><div begin="1:05.938" end="1:16.710" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:05.938" end="1:08.859" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.938" end="1:06.974">以下个绿灯</span><span begin="1:06.974" end="1:07.341">亮</span><span begin="1:07.341" end="1:07.560">起</span><span begin="1:07.560" end="1:08.382">做信</span><span begin="1:08.382" end="1:08.859">号</span></p><p begin="1:09.009" end="1:12.089" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.009" end="1:10.237">掠过遍布人生</span><span begin="1:10.237" end="1:10.638">指</span><span begin="1:10.638" end="1:10.887">南</span><span begin="1:10.887" end="1:11.694">的街</span><span begin="1:11.694" end="1:12.089">道</span></p><p begin="1:12.269" end="1:16.710" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.269" end="1:13.513">不再回去城市</span><span begin="1:13.513" end="1:13.917">某</span><span begin="1:13.917" end="1:14.162">间</span><span begin="1:14.162" end="1:15.388">禁锢灵</span><span begin="1:15.388" end="1:15.822">魂的</span><span begin="1:15.822" end="1:16.710">巢</